From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mshtml: Display pointers, the caret and computed styles (6051)

IDisplayServices' CreateDisplayPointer, GetCaret and GetComputedStyle gave
E_NOTIMPL. HTML editors in older programs (DHTML edit hosts, mail
composers, CMS editors in a WebBrowser control) place display pointers by
point and by line, move the caret to them, insert text at the caret and ask
what the text there looks like (for their bold/italic toolbar state).

New display.c:
- IDisplayPointer over a markup pointer: MoveToPoint hit-tests the
  character under a point from Gecko's per-character client rects (the
  position after it past its middle, HT_RESULTS_Glyph), MoveUnit (previous
  and next line at an x, line start and end, window top and bottom),
  IsAtBOL, QueryBreaks (<br>, block start), GetLineInfo, GetFlowElement,
  comparisons, gravities, ScrollIntoView, markup pointer conversions;
- IHTMLCaret over the document's selection: moved to display pointers,
  read into markup and display pointers, GetLocation, InsertText leaving
  the caret after the text, Show/Hide, direction;
- IHTMLComputedStyle from Gecko's computed style of the element a markup
  pointer is in (and its ancestors for decorations, offsets, background,
  OL), IsEqual.
The LINE_DIRECTION, HT_OPTIONS, HT_RESULTS and DISPLAY_BREAK enums are
added to mshtml.idl.
---
diff --git a/dlls/mshtml/Makefile.in b/dlls/mshtml/Makefile.in
index 0728635..b77fe2a 100644
--- a/dlls/mshtml/Makefile.in
+++ b/dlls/mshtml/Makefile.in
@@ -7,6 +7,7 @@ SOURCES = \
 	conpoint.c \
 	ctrlrange.c \
 	dispex.c \
+	display.c \
 	editor.c \
 	htmlanchor.c \
 	htmlarea.c \
diff --git a/dlls/mshtml/display.c b/dlls/mshtml/display.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..f4b7058
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/mshtml/display.c
@@ -0,0 +1,1568 @@
